source: tests/help.rs
expression: text
---
Manage named directory aliases

Usage: furet alias <COMMAND>

Commands:
  add     Create an alias to a directory, the current one by default
  list    List aliases as tab-separated lines
  remove  Delete an alias
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help
